  "body": "### Bugfixes\r\n\r\n#### stdlib\r\n\r\n- _(collection)_ **[regression]** Fix `Enum.parse?` max bytesize buffer limit ([#17836], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(crypto)_ Reject malformed Bcrypt hashes ([#17677], thanks @Blacksmoke16)\r\n- _(networking)_ **[security]** Fix validate service for `getaddrinfo` is in range ([#17848], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(networking)_ **[security]** Fix reject control whitespace before field value in HTTP headers ([#17903], thanks @ysbaddaden)\r\n- _(networking)_ **[security]** Fix `close` token in `Connection` header must close connection ([#17904], thanks @ysbaddaden)\r\n- _(networking)_ **[security]** Fix `HTTP::ChunkedContent` must validate the chunk-line ([#17898], thanks @ysbaddaden)\r\n- _(networking)_ **[security]** Fix HTTP must validate content-length header ([#17902], thanks @ysbaddaden)\r\n- _(runtime)_ **[security]** Fix `IO::Delimited` matching after a fragmented delimiter mismatch ([#17916], thanks @ysbaddaden)\r\n- _(serialization)_ Fix reject NUL byte in IO-based JSON lexer ([#17897], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(system)_ Fix `Process::INITIAL_PWD` to ignore access denied error ([#17748], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- _(system)_ Fix `File.symlink` discover target file type on Windows ([#17742], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n\r\n[#17677]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17677\r\n[#17742]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17742\r\n[#17748]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17748\r\n[#17836]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17836\r\n[#17848]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17848\r\n[#17897]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17897\r\n[#17898]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17898\r\n[#17902]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17902\r\n[#17903]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17903\r\n[#17904]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17904\r\n[#17916]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17916\r\n\r\n### Infrastructure\r\n\r\n- Changelog for 1.22.3 ([#17924], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n- Release 1.22.3 ([#17925], thanks @straight-shoota)\r\n\r\n[#17924]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17924\r\n[#17925]: https://github.com/crystal-lang/crystal/pull/17925\r\n\r\n",
